    "title": "An assist on Boston’s only goal in Utah",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Marchand earned the lone assist on Cole Koepke’s goal at 12:49 of the second period. Boston held that 1–0 lead until Utah tied it with 5:09 left in regulation, then lost 2–1 in overtime. This record documents Marchand’s assist on the opening goal, not a Marchand goal.",
      "Shared identification under review: records 57 and 313 reference the same photographed puck and hologram RG13313204. Both catalog records are retained pending owner clarification; this does not establish two distinct physical pucks."
    ],
